      "title": "Tono's New Bicycle",
      "body": [
        "Today is Tono's eighth birthday. In the morning, his father gives him a big box. Tono opens it and finds a red bicycle! 'Thank you, Dad!' he shouts happily.",
        "After breakfast, Tono practices in the yard. His father holds the saddle so Tono does not fall. 'Pedal slowly and look forward,' says his father. Tono tries again and again.",
        "In the afternoon, Tono can ride alone around the yard. His mother claps from the kitchen window. Tono feels very proud. It is his best birthday ever."
