      "title": "The Fishing Trip with Uncle Joko",
      "body": [
        "Last Sunday, Raka went fishing with his uncle Joko. They left home at four thirty in the morning, when the sky was still dark. Uncle Joko drove them to a quiet lake behind the hills.",
        "At the lake, they prepared their fishing rods and used worms as bait. 'Fishing needs patience,' Uncle Joko said. For two hours, nothing happened, but Raka waited quietly. Then, suddenly, his rod moved!",
